  "id": "spatial-intelligence",
  "term": "spatial intelligence",
  "definition": "Spatial intelligence is a distinct area of cognition involving understanding spatial representations and the relationships among objects or features in space. It supports learning in fields such as mathematics and geography and is linked to later success in STEM.",
